},
{
"id": "7428a7be",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "GO GO GO! Hurdles! SPACE to jump!"
},
{
"id": "d5c5ee8c",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "Wire! Tap CROUCH and crawl, maggot!"
},
{
"id": "09272d51",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "Wire! C to crouch and crawl, maggot! Lower! LOWER!"
},
{
"id": "7adc8791",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "Tyres! High knees! Shoot the pop-ups! She's timing you!"
},
{
"id": "00524f92",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "Right, new guy. Pick up the DICK-47. That's your rifle. Yes. It is. Don't make it weird."
},
{
"id": "96e950e0",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "Tap the right side to fire from the hip. The butts. Shoot the butts."
},
{
"id": "50c2b8a9",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "Click to fire from the hip. The butts. Shoot the butts."
},
{
"id": "48c1921c",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "Hip fire's not accurate. Like you. Now do it properly."
},
{
"id": "aba61f3f",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "Tap AIM. Look down the shaft. Line the heart up with the tip."
},
{
"id": "bd59911d",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "Right-click. Aim down the sights. Line the heart up with the tip. Yes, the tip."
},
{
"id": "c2257b48",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "PROPERLY. Tap AIM first. Then shoot."
},
{
"id": "c01774ba",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "PROPERLY. Hold right-click to aim first. Then shoot."
},
{
"id": "65e021e3",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "Beautiful. You look down that shaft like you were born to. Gate's open."
},
{
"id": "bc6f38a5",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "That's the sound. Wet. Now eat both eggplants \u2014 they heal you."
},
{
"id": "2434d0a3",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "Look at you. Big boy now. Next room's got rubbers in it."
},
{
"id": "ab23b268",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "THE COURSE. North gate. Hurdles, wire, tyres, flag. Shoot everything that pops up."
},
{
"id": "93e97c75",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "TOO SLOW. Again. She is not impressed."
},
{
"id": "6c21231d",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "South gate. Grenade pit. Then Captain Prick wants a word. In THE PIT."
},
{
"id": "be843090",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "Nut-nades. Pull the pin \u2014 it's a pube, don't ask \u2014 and LOB it over the wall."
},
{
"id": "b13e76ea",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "Look UP a bit to throw further. Tap NUT."
},
{
"id": "552642a6",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "Look up a bit to throw further. Press G. You can't shoot through the wall, genius."
},
{
"id": "6ec2d221",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "More nuts. We have SO many nuts."
},
{
"id": "1de40b3a",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "Close enough. I'll put that down as a pass. Barely."
},
{
"id": "9dd43c2f",
"who": "SARGE",
"text": "Good arm. She'd be proud. Now get in THE PIT. Prick's waiting."
},
{
"id": "782e90eb",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "So you're the new bloke. Captain Prick. It's pronounced the way you think."
},
{
"id": "a510d1e3",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Killhouse. Pop-ups, plywood, one Nan. Clock starts when you go in. Nut-nade the third room BEFORE you enter."
},
{
"id": "0c98fb09",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Record is nineteen point two. Mine. I had a hangover and one boot on."
},
{
"id": "3ac71633",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "GO GO GO!"
},
{
"id": "e0f078be",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Nut in the room! Tap NUT!"
},
{
"id": "568ff854",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Nut in the room! Press G!"
},
{
"id": "f03329e0",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Last corridor! Sprint to the flag!"
},
{
"id": "4cca2513",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Nineteen point... under. Under?! Nobody tell the lads."
},
{
"id": "5ccf928e",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Soap. Pack your lube. We ride at midnight."
},
{
"id": "adbc24c6",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Bollocks. They've seen us. Weapons free."
},
{
"id": "9cda2c55",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Quiet now. Stay low. Move slow. Follow me."
},
{
"id": "25ed8d4e",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "See the carousel over there? Pride of Pubyat. Remember it. We'll need it later."
},
{
"id": "2eebde77",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Farmhouse. Three inside. Leave them. Not worth the paperwork."
},
{
"id": "2ee5b5ab",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "The apartments. Pubyat Heights. Rent is very reasonable now."
},
{
"id": "0b665b7e",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Crab. He's eating. Leave him be."
},
{
"id": "69d8db3e",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "...Don't ask what."
},
{
"id": "f11d0248",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "The overlook is the far flat on the right. The one with the balcony."
},
{
"id": "d6eb73bd",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Two rubbers. Tree line. Both looking the other way. Lovely."
},
{
"id": "817cf6b7",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "I'll take the one on the right. You take the left. On three. ...Or whenever. I'm old."
},
{
"id": "25f966a4",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Beautiful."
},
{
"id": "8dd197af",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "CHOPPER. GET DOWN. In the grass. Don't. Move."
},
{
"id": "6c3ed714",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "...Gone. Good. Keep moving."
},
{
"id": "3d315675",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Convoy. Down. DOWN. In the ditch."
},
{
"id": "37767343",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "If you so much as scratch, we're both dead."
},
{
"id": "adf0623c",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Don't. Move."
},
{
"id": "be3e850b",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Steady..."
},
{
"id": "b641dd5b",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Easy... easy..."
},
{
"id": "3b378da9",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Nobody breathe."
},
{
"id": "3d53d48c",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "If he looks this way, think grass thoughts."
},
{
"id": "ffc39856",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "...Okay. Go. Across the road. Mind the chlamydia."
},
{
"id": "e3e042c6",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Too much chlamydia in that field. We go around. The long way. Always the long way."
},
{
"id": "11b1e5e4",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "There. The plaza. He's arriving. Fur coat. Both arms. For now."
},
{
"id": "ec0b757b",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Aim down the sights. Account for the wind. And the Coriolis effect. And his feelings."
},
{
"id": "e4c5832d",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Right-click, aim. Account for the wind. And the Coriolis effect. And his feelings."
},
{
"id": "a2069fac",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Target down... no. He's lost an arm. Bloody hell, Leftenant."
},
{
"id": "a3575877",
"who": "JACKOFF",
"text": "MY ARM! MY BEAUTIFUL WANKING ARM!"
},
{
"id": "fd1688cb",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "HUNG-24! Attack chopper! Fire exit, down the stairs, GO!"
},
{
"id": "f83dea5e",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "My leg's gone. Crab got it. Put me down by the carousel. I'll cover the road."
},
{
"id": "f47048f9",
"who": "PILOT",
"text": "Big Bird to Pubyat, one hundred seconds out. Hold what you've got."
},
{
"id": "33b10c45",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Got him."
},
{
"id": "55dedd75",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Tango down. Still got it."
},
{
"id": "54075b08",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "One less rubber."
},
{
"id": "45e8fcca",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "More coming up the road!"
},
{
"id": "c9aec08f",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Crabs, east side!"
},
{
"id": "21075c4a",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "They're in the bumper cars!"
},
{
"id": "9b9adf1a",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Contact! Behind the candy floss!"
},
{
"id": "c3bfa5a8",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Keep them off me, Leftenant. I'm very old."
},
{
"id": "572d327d",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "The HUNG is pulling off! Must need a refuel. Or a cuddle."
},
{
"id": "3b0c398d",
"who": "PILOT",
"text": "Big Bird on station! Pop smoke!"
},
{
"id": "3ae9c615",
"who": "PILOT",
"text": "Big Bird, final approach. Ramp coming down. Get your arses in."
},
{
"id": "26dea9d7",
"who": "PILOT",
"text": "Ramp's down! GO GO GO!"
},
{
"id": "0cd43d54",
"who": "PILOT",
"text": "Everybody in? Lifting!"
},
{
"id": "129a50c8",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Everybody on? GO! GO!"
},
{
"id": "67908413",
"who": "MACMILLI",
"text": "Mark my words, Leftenant: fifteen years from now he's going to be very upset about that arm."
},
{
"id": "8e1e9164",
"who": "PILOT",
"text": "HUNG's strafing!"
},
{
"id": "cafea12c",
"who": "PILOT",
"text": "Incoming from the chopper!"
},
{
"id": "01a33500",
"who": "PILOT",
"text": "Get under something!"
},
{
"id": "183aea4c",
"who": "GAS",
"text": "Bridge. They're all asleep."
},
{
"id": "1a3452e9",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Well. Wake them up. Politely. With your dick."
},
{
"id": "c5ad7630",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Crew quarters. Check your corners. Check your corners."
},
{
"id": "df9f76a1",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "The hold. Package should be at the far end. Smells like eggplant."
},
{
"id": "3a75ab3c",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Bravo Six, going wet."
},
{
"id": "6b819120",
"who": "PILOT",
"text": "Rules of engagement, sir? The crew?"
},
{
"id": "60708386",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Expendable. Rubbers and crabs. Mostly rubbers."
},
{
"id": "e2dfe67e",
"who": "PILOT",
"text": "I've got the minigun on the deck. Call it."
},
{
"id": "5beb23b7",
"who": "PILOT",
"text": "Minigun! Minigun!"
},
{
"id": "dfc7020f",
"who": "PILOT",
"text": "Got one on the hatch."
},
{
"id": "31c9765d",
"who": "PILOT",
"text": "Brrrrrt."
},
{
"id": "0c2bfadc",
"who": "PILOT",
"text": "Tango down. Very down."
},
{
"id": "1c1cae45",
"who": "SOUP",
"text": "More out of the stairwell!"
},
{
"id": "622605bc",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Bridge secure."
},
{
"id": "0e4b808c",
"who": "GAS",
"text": "He was holding a teddy."
},
{
"id": "2ddcfe94",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Expendable teddy."
},
{
"id": "9eb43c55",
"who": "SOUP",
"text": "They're waking up! Doors on both sides!"
},
{
"id": "eedd93a0",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Stairs to the hold, far end. Keep moving."
},
{
"id": "286be7b2",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Eggplant detector's on. The faster it ticks, the closer you are. Like dating."
},
{
"id": "fe825f89",
"who": "SOUP",
"text": "Up on the containers! Left side!"
},
{
"id": "ede89ab1",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Got the manifest. Let's go."
},
{
"id": "b7ed93ad",
"who": "PILOT",
"text": "Fast movers inbound! Get out of there!"
},
{
"id": "241a48e5",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "That's a bomb. Ship's going down. Move it, move it, MOVE IT!"
},
{
"id": "bef983c5",
"who": "PILOT",
"text": "I see you! Ramp's down! JUMP!"
},
{
"id": "3db1f31f",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "JUMP FOR IT!"
},
{
"id": "d21a756f",
"who": "JACKOFF",
"text": "Airport security. Deal with it. Slowly."
},
{
"id": "829a496e",
"who": "JACKOFF",
"text": "Nearly there, gentlemen. Nobody. Rush."
},
{
"id": "5df990db",
"who": "JACKOFF",
"text": "Gentlemen. Today is a very special day."
},
{
"id": "243f651c",
"who": "JACKOFF",
"text": "Remember..."
},
{
"id": "7c6480a8",
"who": "JACKOFF",
"text": "...no rushin'."
},
{
"id": "85d932cc",
"who": "JACKOFF",
"text": "Gentlemen..."
},
{
"id": "043fd687",
"who": "JACKOFF",
"text": "...welcome to the Pleasure Dome."
},
{
"id": "726ef65e",
"who": "JACKOFF",
"text": "Now you can rush."
},
{
"id": "813ad2c8",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Back of the truck, son. They're coming up behind us. Fire at will. Will's the crab."
},
{
"id": "4f55d752",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "HE SHOT DOWN THE BLOODY CHOPPER."
},
{
"id": "7bfdde0c",
"who": "SOUP",
"text": "CHOPPER! HUNG-24, right on our arse!"
},
{
"id": "6f7588fb",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Glob the rotor! Everything you've got!"
},
{
"id": "e397a06e",
"who": "GAS",
"text": "It's pulling off!"
},
{
"id": "eb1371e3",
"who": "GROPES",
"text": "Trucks! Two trucks behind us!"
},
{
"id": "9fd6ec2a",
"who": "SOUP",
"text": "Bridge! We're almost across!"
},
{
"id": "6287a746",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Don't say that. Never say that."
},
{
"id": "d5ec7675",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "HOLD ON!"
},
{
"id": "b6f41149",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Over here, son! Behind the wreck! They're coming down the bridge!"
},
{
"id": "2a4e3d4f",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "More coming!"
},
{
"id": "f781e32b",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Keep your head down!"
},
{
"id": "f9b557aa",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Nearly there, son. Nearly."
},
{
"id": "fd4c2747",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Here comes the tanker..."
},
{
"id": "6ae6cf02",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "TANKER! GET DOW\u2014"
},
{
"id": "1159808e",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "The bridge... Soup! Gas! Gropes! Sound off!"
},
{
"id": "80a51b1c",
"who": "SOUP",
"text": "Gas is down!"
},
{
"id": "577760fd",
"who": "SOUP",
"text": "Gropes! No... no."
},
{
"id": "222cc5a3",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "...Soup."
},
{
"id": "278d4ac6",
"who": "JACKOFF",
"text": "Hello, little fella. I'd shake your hand, but... you know."
},
{
"id": "d8e7d6a9",
"who": "JACKOFF",
"text": "You took my arm. I'm going to take everything."
},
{
"id": "c00fa2b5",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "Son... catch."
},
{
"id": "8d845772",
"who": "JACKOFF",
"text": "...oh."
},
{
"id": "02be1424",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "We got you, son. We got you."
},
{
"id": "5c80407c",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "It's over. She said... she said you did great."
},
{
"id": "c1dae1d7",
"who": "YOU",
"text": "GET IT OFF ME!"
},
{
"id": "e0295336",
"who": "YOU",
"text": "I only fuck raw."
},
{
"id": "c40f852b",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "nice shot, son."
},
{
"id": "800f8e69",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "that one felt good, huh?"
},
{
"id": "be4a6176",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "wow. you're a natural."
},
{
"id": "375edc7b",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "she said don't stop."
},
{
"id": "92370744",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "veiny AND accurate."
},
{
"id": "8f1844e5",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "keep stroking, champ."
},
{
"id": "61bd2c21",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "so hard right now."
},
{
"id": "7ff436eb",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "mmm. that's the spot."
},
{
"id": "5a77fa4c",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "moan for me, soldier."
},
{
"id": "57d930ac",
"who": "PRICK",
"text": "harder, daddy."
},
{
